---
import { BaseLayout } from "@walle/layouts";
import { SectionHeaderStandard } from "@walle/components";

const lastUpdated = "August 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  headerTitle="Terms & Conditions"
  headerDescription="The terms that govern use of italiaopensource.com."
  headerRobots="noindex, follow"
>
  <SectionHeaderStandard
    title="Terms & Conditions"
    subtitle="The terms that govern use of italiaopensource.com."
    variant="secondary"
  />

  <article class="legal">
    <p class="legal__meta">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <h2>1. About this site</h2>
    <p>
      italiaopensource.com is a free, community-maintained directory published by Italia
      Open-Source. It lists open-source projects, tech communities and partners sourced from the
      public
      <a href="https://github.com/italia-opensource/awesome-italia-opensource" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
        >awesome-italia-opensource</a
      > repository. By using the site you agree to these terms.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Use of the site</h2>
    <p>
      The site is read-only: there are no accounts, no sign-up, and nothing to purchase. You may
      browse it freely for lawful purposes. You agree not to misuse it, attempt to disrupt it, or
      access it in a way that could damage the service or other users.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Listings and submissions</h2>
    <p>
      Projects and communities are added or updated through pull requests on
      <a href="https://github.com/italia-opensource/awesome-italia-opensource" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
        >awesome-italia-opensource</a
      >, governed by that repository's own
      <a href="https://github.com/italia-opensource/awesome-italia-opensource/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
        >contributing guidelines</a
      >. Community Partner applications are submitted through a Google Form. We review submissions
      before they appear on the site, but we don't vouch for or endorse the accuracy of third-party
      listings, and each listed project keeps its own license.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      The site's own code is open source under the
      <a href="https://github.com/italia-opensource/italiaopensource.com/blob/main/LICENSE" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
        >GPL-3.0 license</a
      >. The "Italia Open-Source" name and logo belong to Italia Open-Source. Listed projects and
      communities retain their own branding and licensing.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      The site is provided "as is", without warranties of any kind. Listing data is synced from the
      awesome-italia-opensource repository and third-party GitHub metadata, and we do not guarantee
      it is complete, accurate, or up to date.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the extent permitted by law, Italia Open-Source is not liable for any indirect or
      consequential loss arising from use of the site or reliance on a listing.
    </p>

    <h2>7. External links</h2>
    <p>
      Nearly every listing links to a third-party website (a GitHub repository, a community page, a
      company site). We are not responsible for their content or practices; visiting them is at your
      own risk.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Changes</h2>
    <p>
      These terms may be updated at any time. Continued use of the site after changes take effect
      means you accept the revised terms.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these terms can be sent via
      <a href="https://github.com/italia-opensource/awesome-italia-opensource/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
        >GitHub Issues</a
      > or through our
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/italia-open-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn page</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-3xl) var(--space-xl) var(--space-4xl);
  }

  .legal__meta {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .legal h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
</style>
